        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-04T20:23:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Having fought Matriarch twice this week, I find myself wondering if there was a stage in playtest where Horrid Cacophony dealt 1 damage for each Fowl in play.&nbsp; It seems like that would be more flavorfully fitting, even if it would be less functional in game terms (hideously crushing in games where you were already losing, but useless in the situation you described).</p>",
