      {
        "id": 60456,
        "name": "Isotope-X",
        "username": "Isotope-X",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/i/dbc845/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-19T12:45:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"j1hopki1\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/58f4c7/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> j1hopki1:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Omnitronks feels like cheating. I've had turns where it put 4 cards into play. If the villain had some kind of AI, Omnitron-X would be breakable, but otherwise it's a beast.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Omnitron-X is probably my favorite character in the game. &nbsp;A base power that allows you to manipulate ANY DECK IN THE GAME is playing on a different level than everyone else.</p>",
