      {
        "id": 60457,
        "name": "McBehrer",
        "username": "McBehrer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-19T18:19:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Except that he has the second lowest base HP, and all of his toys breaks if you take 5 damage in a turn. (It doesn't even have to be in one hit; 5 1-point hits will do the trick.) Coupled with his awesome, but limited shields, and if you're going against someone like Apostate, Dawn, Spite, La Capitan, Miss Information (God forbid), or the Matriarch, who have a tendency to throw out multiple types of damage -- sometimes irreducible -- you can have a hard time setting up.</p>",
