        "created_at": "2014-01-23T23:06:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"UXM266\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/uxm266/48/1966_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> UXM266:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Omnitron-X with Unity?</p>\n<p>Damn, we just demoslished the enemy.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I'm guessing the enemy was not Iron Legacy.&nbsp; Those low HP numbers would have made rather a big difference in his case, not to mention the hitting-all-hero-targets-including-bots, or the extreme amounts of damage breaking Components.</p>",
