      {
        "id": 60466,
        "name": "Braithwhite",
        "username": "Braithwhite",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/braithwhite/{size}/1854_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-24T17:10:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You might be surprised how effective Unity can be against IL. &nbsp;You have to change her playstyle (bee bots and platform bots are great), but you can be staggeringly effective once you get into the mindset of the \"right bot\" as opposed to a swarm of them. Since he also tends to smack around the lowest, you can have a lot of fun with volatile parts and robot bombs.</p><p>None of this is to imply that its easy!&nbsp;</p>",
