      {
        "id": 60467,
        "name": "JimmytheRat",
        "username": "JimmytheRat",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/c37758/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-25T02:26:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>On the other hand, Unity is phenomenally good against Dawn. &nbsp;She doesn't even flinch when That Card comes out, and she's got enough card draw and bot reclamation that Blinding Blast doesn't hurt much either. &nbsp;Unity ends up mopping the floor with her almost every time they meet.</p>",
